# Get your form ID from https://formspree.io/
# 1. Sign up (free) at formspree.io
# 2. Create a new form → set email to mrudulsavant0000@gmail.com
# 3. Copy the 8-character form ID from the endpoint URL, e.g.:
#    https://formspree.io/f/abcd1234  →  ID is  abcd1234
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=YOUR_FORM_ID
